# Weathered Runestone: "Nonland permanent cards in graveyards and libraries can't enter the battlefield" (CR 101.2,
# 110.4a) is anyone's, and names graveyards and libraries only. Bot1 casts the Runestone and Ephemerate on Ornithopter:
# the Ornithopter, a nonland permanent card, returns from exile (and again on turn 3 from the rebound). On turn 2 Bot2
# loots a Guerrilla Gorilla into its graveyard; on turn 3 Bot1's Animate Dead targets it, but the opponent's card
# can't enter, so it stays in Bot2's graveyard, and Animate Dead, which lost "enchant creature card in a graveyard" as its
# ability resolved, is put into Bot1's graveyard (CR 613.1f, 704.5m).

